  "notes": [
    "Copy .env.example to .env and set CPA_BASE_URL, CPA_MANAGEMENT_KEY, and a private LOGIN_PASSWORD before starting; authentication is enabled by default.",
    "The persisted .env file contains CPA credentials and the login password. Protect it as a secret, and use AUTH_ENABLED=false only in an isolated deployment.",
